Overall, AuralNet demonstrated significant improvements over DeepEar in both sound detection and localization tasks. Its architecture, including the coarse detection task, hierarchical structure, and custom loss function, contributed to its superior performance, making it a promising solution for real-world multi-BSSL scenarios.

