\section{Tournament Robustness}

In this section, we first explain how the conduction of a tournament relates to communication protocols. Then we introduce a ternary robust tournament tree that is inspired by the communication protocol described in \cref{sec:protocol1}. Finally, we present a binary robust tournament tree based on the communication protocol described in \cref{sec:protocol2}.

\subsection{Tournaments and Communication Protocols}
