%-convex/concave \cite{DBLP:journals/eor/EgebladNO07}

%-SMT results \cite{Nikken2020}
%-CSP results \cite{DBLP:journals/anor/KorfMP10}, \cite{DBLP:conf/aips/MoffittP06}

