\noindent {\bf STRATEGY 3}: Declare $CA(90')$ of size $n$ as maximal length CAs if {\bf procedure $CA(90')$} and {\bf procedure $CA(150')$} both return ``True'' for $n$.\footnote{It is interesting to note that if one interchanges the role of $CA(90')$ and $CA(150')$ in this strategy, then she can get similar result.} \\

