{\sc{Gray}}$_{0}$	&000	&000 & - & -\\
{\sc{Gray}}$_{1}$	&001	&001 & 0 & 0\\
{\sc{Gray}}$_{2}$	&010	&011 & 0,1 & 1\\
{\sc{Gray}}$_{3}$	&011	&010 & 0& 0\\
{\sc{Gray}}$_{4}$	&100	&110 & 0,1,2& 2\\
{\sc{Gray}}$_{5}$	&101	&111 & 0& 0\\
